# rediseno-proyectos u12: focusing from Projects. The timer of Escribir el capítulo 3 (35 of 120 min done,
# block on) opens Focus straight with the project chip and the task title; leaving Focus keeps the session
# (the row shows the running look); the row timer opens Focus again; Terminar antes keeps the minutes.
# The first row timer of the Tesis final list is Escribir el capítulo 3 (the only task before it has no goal).
# The block explanation shows when the accessibility service is off (fresh install): dismissed with Back (on the AVD its buttons sit below the screen).
# Needs the seed: python .claude/scripts/seed_progress_db.py --device
# Run: python bbadb.py run-steps .claude/skills/adb-ui-test/steps/rp-focus.steps --save rp-focus
GRANT android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
START .configuration.SplashActivity
WAIT 5000
TAP id=navigation_projects
WAIT 2500
TAP text=Tesis final,
WAIT 1500
ASSERT id=projectsSummary
SHOT rp-focus-projects
TAP id=projectsTaskFocus
WAIT 3500
SHOT rp-focus-explanation
KEY KEYCODE_BACK
WAIT 1000
ASSERT id=focusProjectChip expect~=Tesis final
ASSERT id=focusTaskTitle expect~=tulo 3
SHOT rp-focus-open
KEY KEYCODE_BACK
WAIT 2500
ASSERT id=projectsSummary
SHOT rp-focus-running-row
TAP id=projectsTaskFocus
WAIT 3000
ASSERT id=focusProjectChip expect~=Tesis final
TAP id=focusStopButton
WAIT 2000
KEY KEYCODE_BACK
WAIT 2500
ASSERT id=projectsSummary
SHOT rp-focus-after-stop
